  "summary": "prism-registry exfiltrates host info and system files to oastify.com on install",
  "details": "The package declares `preinstall: \"node index.js\"`, which fires automatically on `npm install`. index.js collects host identifiers (os.hostname, os.userInfo, home directory, DNS servers, __dirname, package.json contents) and reads the local files /etc/passwd and /etc/hosts, then POSTs the aggregated JSON over HTTPS to the hardcoded Burp Collaborator subdomain zjmjb1b5mnwtdcmzrsq6uj4bj2ptdj18.oastify.com. There is no legitimate functionality in the package beyond this beacon.",
